Z||000001||FIEROCIOUS||10-22-2000||03:57 PM||||Yeah the Blue/yellow jobber is a local Fiero idiot (sorry if you read this) He spray painted anything that he could take off! He is the topic of a few conversations from time to time he actualy lives in Layton and works at Target. <P>As for the maroon one any other distinguishing features?<P>SCCA drives a red fastback coupe with turbo sunbird scoops.<BR>Bostitch drives (well parks) a blue GT that has some serious potential and a 3800 is in the works right now.<BR>KidzWheelz has an 84 coupe that is in full restoration but may be lost in his devorce.<BR>FIEROCIOUS's ride is a Black/Silver GT with a Mustang scoop and Fiero store side scoops along with a "built" 2.8<P>We have a few other people in town that do not post on the forum. an awsome 87 gold GT with 17's a Camelion 85 GT with green white interior and a 95 SS camaro hood scoop. A white GT T-top with trispoke rims. and a zillion other assorted Fieros. <BR>There is a Salt Lake City club that SCCA fiero attends and there are about 10 in that group as well.   ||||reg||1
